OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry this
OL,6,Fevening and overnight with variable
OL,7,Famounts of cloud with some clear
OL,8,Fspells. Cloud increasing from the
OL,9,Fnorth later, perhaps with an odd
OL,10,Fshower in the far west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FMostly dry, but often
OL,13,Fcloudy. A chance of some rain across
OL,14,Fthe north of the region during the
OL,15,Fmorning. Skies clearing from the west
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
