OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely dry with sunny spells Thursday
OL,7,Fbefore another band of rain moves into
OL,8,Fthe northwest into Friday. This
OL,9,Fclearing southwards on Saturday.
OL,10,FAverage temperatures by day but chilly
OL,11,Fat night.
